@*
  Export portfolio while its subject is read (T379, flow 13, R3-E14): one card of still lines in .export-page, no form and
  no Export PDF. Raw .skeleton with flow 11's .skel-* classes: Skeleton's Width and Height write an inline style.
*@
<div class="export-page" aria-busy="true">
  <div class="detail-card" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="skeleton skel-title"></div>
    <div class="skeleton skel-line"></div>
    <div class="skeleton skel-line"></div>
    <div class="skeleton skel-line skel-short"></div>
  </div>
</div>
